FreeSense Fleet: central management for many FreeSense firewalls.

Run it on one FreeSense firewall (the controller). Invite other firewalls
with a join link and a separate join key, approve them after comparing a
verification code, and follow their status over an encrypted WireGuard
management tunnel that the managed firewalls start themselves.

The managed side is built into FreeSense (freesense-join, console option 17).
